[2026-05-10T14:15:32.309Z] [STDOUT] ## Summary
- Replaced the SmartQ placeholder route with the report flow on `/smartq/:reportId?`.
- Added legacy SmartQ metadata loading, type validation, default limit handling, wildcard filter serialization, report rendering, and loading/error states.
- Added the AI-chat panel with per-report persisted history, mention autocomplete input, sanitized assistant HTML rendering, and an `ai-chat` service wrapper.
- Added fixtures and tests for SmartQ suggestions, chat responses, loading/error fixtures, mention autocomplete, message rendering, API normalization, and the Playwright smoke path.
- Kept the branch current with `origin/main` and fixed integration regressions found during that merge: dictionary-shaped `/terms` normalization and persisted sidebar resize width.

## Reproduction
Before this change, `/my/smartq/900` did not route to a SmartQ report and `/my/smartq` rendered the SQL builder placeholder instead of the SmartQ/AI-chat scenario.

## Verification
- `npm test -- --run` (24 files, 113 tests)
- `npm run build`
- `PLAYWRIGHT_PORT=32035 npx playwright test` (27 tests)

## Screenshot
![SmartQ AI-chat](https://github.com/ideav/vue-gram/blob/issue-27-48654a43be88/docs/screenshots/smartq-ai-chat.png?raw=true)

Closes #27

